- Don't worry, it's no longer Danger-Russ.

00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:47.125
- He has the best foot, so he is the best footballer.

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:49.250
- Nah, nah, nah.
- That could not matter less.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.791
- Ugly Americans.

00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:53.375
- So how do you keep getting better as you get older?

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:56.500
- The trick is to get the hell away from New Jersey.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.250
- Hey, look, Gronk!

00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.791
